<title>EGYPT: Drunken Bahrainis removed from Gulf Air flight.</title>
<headline>Drunken Bahrainis removed from Gulf Air flight.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian authorities removed three Bahrainis from a Gulf Air plane flying from Bahrain to Casablanca on Saturday because they were drunk.</p>
<p>The captain of the plane took advantage of a stopover in Cairo to report the Bahrainis and ask for their removal, airport sources said. He said they had frightened other passengers.</p>
<p>The three men were persuaded to leave the plane peacefully, the sources added.</p>
</text>
